  "source": {
    "kbid": "mac-operator-mcp",
    "kb_id": "90f1df58-87f6-4f47-aa9a-2881c478f8a0",
    "kb_item_id": "d3c96dfd-d71b-4ccf-9d09-8b35e98185aa",
    "source_text": "Purpose: discover Git/Node/Python/Docker/Swift/etc project roots under explicit allowed roots. Input: roots:string[], types?:string[], max_results?:1..500. Output: project roots/types and safe indicators only. Contract: L1 read_only; scope mac.project.read; target filesystem_roots; timeout 30000ms; cap 512KiB; network none; filesystem read_allowed_roots; deny secret content; approval trusted_read; idempotent yes. Phase 2 planned."
